<p><code>TabId</code>, <code>TabMeta</code>, <code>TabSummary</code>, <code>TabsVariant</code>, <code>TabsSemantics</code>, <code>TabsMount</code>, <code>TabsActivation</code>, <code>TabsBeforeChange</code>, <code>TabsTransition</code>, <code>TabsTextAlign</code>, <code>TabsSyncHistory</code>, <code>TabLinkTarget</code>, <code>TabPosition</code>, <code>RegisteredTabInput</code>, <code>RegisteredTabEntry</code>, <code>UseTabsOptions</code>, <code>UseTabsReturn</code>, <code>ClassValue</code>, <code>ClassValueOrFn</code>, <code>TeleportTarget</code>, <code>MaybeFn</code>.</p>
